{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】踏入秋季，東北季候風逐漸支配華南，但熱帶氣旋仍有機會進入南海。若兩個天氣系統同時出現，為香港帶來強風，究竟天文台會發出俗稱「風球」的熱帶氣旋警告信號，還是俗稱「黑球」的強烈季候風信號？第五百一十四集『氣象冷知識』為大家詳細介紹。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:39:23.232937+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T13:38:00.245392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:38:19.057181+00:00","content_hash":"bc04d9c1b4404cdcf1a19284fd31dd21d37dabf4d11aa5472946ef8c257ffa1c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}